{"parse":{"title":"特性/装甲战车","pageid":8194,"revid":20195,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%A3%85%E7%94%B2%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%A3%85%E7%94%B2%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7/%E8%A3%85%E7%94%B2%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>装甲战车</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A3.85.E7.94.B2.E6.88.98.E8.BD.A6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"装甲战车\"><b>装甲战车</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">特性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"特性 冰原裂齿猪.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png/80px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png/120px-%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7_%E5%86%B0%E5%8E%9F%E8%A3%82%E9%BD%BF%E7%8C%AA.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/2/23/9qg91ojc6ci9irji477j2sp4fngb4bf.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />装甲战车\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:55%;\">\n<p>✦获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">免疫高级</font></span>]，不会受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"受伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">受伤</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"濒死\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">濒死</font></span></span>]状态的效果影响。<br />✦[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">百分比伤害</span>]降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>。<br />✦与[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">使徒</span>]分摊伤害（共享生命值）。<br />✦首次触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">不屈</font></span></span>]时，移除场上所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">使徒</span>]，并进行变身。<br />✦战斗开始或触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">不屈</font></span></span>]时，获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">75</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">加厚装甲</span>]，效果：每层提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">40</font>点防御，受到伤害时移除<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层。<br />✦被击败时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">70%</font>生命，驱散所有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，且攻防属性提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。<br />✦玩家可多次击败首领以获得更多积分，即使被击败也不会战斗失败。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:25%;\" rowspan=\"1\"><b>该特性属于</b><br /><div class=\"hero_box\">\n<div class=\"hero_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E9%AD%94%E7%89%A9%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D\" title=\"魔物图鉴库/第七灾厄“战车”\"><img alt=\"第七灾厄“战车” 像素模型.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/bwku7gchj1aabegqzy1yel7hrbmzo9w.png/75px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/bwku7gchj1aabegqzy1yel7hrbmzo9w.png/113px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/de/bwku7gchj1aabegqzy1yel7hrbmzo9w.png/150px-%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E7%81%BE%E5%8E%84%E2%80%9C%E6%88%98%E8%BD%A6%E2%80%9D_%E5%83%8F%E7%B4%A0%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164231\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.124 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 920/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14712/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3602/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  107.777      1 模板:特性\n100.00%  107.777      1 -total\n 61.43%   66.206      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n 56.07%   60.428     10 模板:中括号介绍\n  8.74%    9.424      1 模板:面包屑\n  4.85%    5.224      1 模板:魔物图\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:8194-0!dateformat=default an